<description>&lt;p&gt;U.S. soldiers are now operating with Ecuadorian forces against cartels and MQ-9 Reaper drones have been moved from Africa to support missions in Colombia and Ecuador. A fishing vessel off Ecuador's coast was attacked, killing multiple people and extending the violence to the maritime domain. Ecuador captured four members of the border commandos accused of killing soldiers, while Peru and Ecuador increased cooperation to counter illegal mining that fuels organized crime. Pressure on the Los Choneros cartel is shifting from its leadership to its logistics networks, and 2 battle-related deaths occurred in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNUUI1em1XNkE0c1c0a29xRFJTeGRZVnNxc1FUWGdKYkppS3JoU1VObm9XbGZWbXZNUmExdG5icUhQZTN5TEJPdEJGd2dYOHZMeHVoRVRzVk51YjR2aGFpQ2RVRXVfZ3BLRWI4cFVZdGd4Zm5aTkE5N3JJUGN1Ny1acWE5bjNwZHlrVlJKZkZ6OWUtU2lUTWNhOG4zVWUzSkJsZjlVNHdGZFdjNlFXS01PeElIbU9mTUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Soy Futbol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNajk4RkFKd3lCTjdJLUE0SVdPYVQydTB6ZDE1S0t2N281d1hMb0h4VEVuTk9sdkw3WEczRVV5c3B4MzVzbFN0T0ZLYk1pSVAwMFJINmM4NmplZjQ5bnFWbjlVcTNQd0xwTjROeHFiQ1llZVhZdS00T2NBNXgzWGJ5bDZjNWVuSWxnVkZNWkdIQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;InSight Crime&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNYk9YOWlBV3FqRWlCM1ZBTnNTODI4eF9SS1dwazYxQkUxSGNqbTk1S2dqS3ZNeDVkbktNSGFHMWpoV0MyX2JxYjc0Y2lSYTBITkhUSkRvTzlnRGVvX25BaERRR2k3aXRpNm5PLWxQejR0R0g2eUtpSDU0SlluRzRHbXZhczVSWjlFOVJDb0Z0VGd4QU1pcHpOc1RoR2JuMXpfYmtmTmR2NHFsQzlzQXpBOEZFZ0daNkFBZGFUS21mczR5VVZENGtULQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Democracy Now!&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;